---
title: Ginger-garlic paste
servings: 1
tags:
  - ingredient
source:
  name: Myself
introduction: For use in other recipes (specifically south asian).
---

Combine @ginger{100%gram}(rough chopped), @garlic{100%gram}(rough chopped), and @neutral oil{30%gram} in a blender or food processor. Blend until smooth.

> Or, use equal parts ginger and garlic, then add 15% of their combined mass in oil.
